<title>USA: PlayNet to remain listed after waiver.</title>
<headline>PlayNet to remain listed after waiver.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PlayNet Technologies Inc said on Wednesday that its shares will remain listed on the Nasdaq small cap market after it received an exception for its regulatory requirements.</p>
<p>The temporary exception is subject to the company meeting certain condtions, PlayNet said in a statement.</p>
<p>The conditions for continued listing were not immediately available.</p>
<p>The listing exception expires on July 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
